---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Jędrzej Szymula — SEO Specialist"
  description="SEO specialist helping brands grow organic traffic through technical SEO, content strategy, and authority building. Available for new projects."
  path="/"
  active="home"
  ogTitle="Jędrzej Szymula — SEO Specialist"
  ogDescription="SEO specialist helping brands grow organic traffic. Case studies, resources, and consulting."
>

  <!-- Results bar -->
  <div class="results-bar">
    <div class="result">
      <span class="result-num">4.89M</span>
      <span class="result-label">GSC impressions, Autopay</span>
    </div>
    <div class="result">
      <span class="result-num">140K</span>
      <span class="result-label">Peak monthly visits</span>
    </div>
    <div class="result">
      <span class="result-num">~1,000</span>
      <span class="result-label">Articles delivered in 12mo</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-label">Featured entries</div>

  <!-- Entry 1: About -->
  <article class="entry">
    <div class="entry-header">
      <span class="entry-word">Jędrzej Szymula</span>
    </div>
    <p class="entry-definition">
      An SEO specialist focused on turning organic search into a predictable growth channel.
      Works with brands to build search strategies that compound over time —
      through <span data-def="The practice of optimizing a site's infrastructure, crawlability, and indexation">technical foundations</span>,
      <span data-def="Aligning content to the intent and language of real search queries">content alignment</span>,
      and <span data-def="Earning links from authoritative external sites to build domain authority">authority building</span>.
    </p>

    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">Technical SEO</span>
      <span class="tag">Content Strategy</span>
      <span class="tag">E-commerce</span>
      <span class="tag">SaaS</span>
    </div>

    <div class="entry-actions">
      <a href="mailto:j.szymula.seo@gmail.com" class="btn">Work with me</a>
      <a href="work.html" class="btn btn-ghost">See the work →</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- Entry 2: Work teaser -->
  <article class="entry">
    <div class="entry-header">
      <span class="entry-word">Case Studies</span>
    </div>
    <p class="entry-definition">
      Documented accounts of SEO challenges, the strategies applied, and the measurable outcomes.
      Each entry details the starting conditions, the interventions, and what changed in organic performance.
    </p>

    <div class="index-grid index-grid--spaced">
      <a href="work.html#flobotics" class="index-item">
        <span class="index-item-word">Flobotics</span>
        <span class="index-item-desc">100K+ reached · Healthcare RCM · 2025–now</span>
      </a>
      <a href="work.html#autopay" class="index-item">
        <span class="index-item-word">mobility.autopay.eu</span>
        <span class="index-item-desc">4.89M impressions · Fintech · 2024–26</span>
      </a>
      <a href="work.html#milo-solutions" class="index-item">
        <span class="index-item-word">Milo Solutions</span>
        <span class="index-item-desc">1,800+ daily visits in 3 months · IT · 2024</span>
      </a>
      <a href="work.html#winiety-online" class="index-item">
        <span class="index-item-word">winiety-online.pl</span>
        <span class="index-item-desc">1,000+ TOP 3 keywords · E-commerce · 2024</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <a href="work.html" class="btn btn-ghost">Read full case studies →</a>
  </article>

  <!-- Entry 3: Resources teaser -->
  <article class="entry">
    <div class="entry-header">
      <span class="entry-word">Resources</span>
    </div>
    <p class="entry-definition">
      Practical SEO tools built from real-world experience:
      checklists, frameworks, and guides distilled into immediately usable formats.
      No fluff — only what has been tested in production.
    </p>
    <p class="entry-example">
      Launching soon. Be first to know when the first resource drops.
    </p>

    <a href="mailto:j.szymula.seo@gmail.com?subject=Notify%20me%20about%20new%20SEO%20resources" class="btn">Email me to get notified</a>
  </article>
</Base>
